00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.860
That question sound familiar?

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.560
I gave you this matrix and said,

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.320
find a w where a times w is 0,

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.580
but w is not the 0 vector.
Of course, that would always

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.420
