00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.020
OK?

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:26.640
What's this asking for?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:28.140
In English,

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.900
remember, anytime you see matrix
times vector, what's the thing

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.900
you should think of
