00:24:52.380 --> 00:24:56.880
What I want you to find

00:25:00.380 --> 00:25:05.520
is find as many linearly
independent vectors as you can.

00:25:16.380 --> 00:25:20.130
where a times whatever vector,

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:23.760
let's call the vectors you find
