00:25:37.400 --> 00:25:39.880
multiply it by 2, 3, or 4.

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:41.560
Because if ax is 0,

00:25:41.560 --> 00:25:44.400
then 2ax is also 0, and 3ax is
