00:26:15.140 --> 00:26:21.890
where Ax is 0, but x is not the
0 vector.

00:26:24.020 --> 00:26:25.020
Brian.

00:26:25.760 --> 00:26:26.580
1,

00:26:26.580 --> 00:26:26.900
0,

00:26:26.900 --> 00:26:27.660
0, 0,

00:26:27.660 --> 00:26:28.740
1 work.

00:26:28.740 --> 00:26:31.900
You said 1, 0, 0, 0, 1.

00:26:31.900 --> 00:26:32.860
Close.

00:26:32.860 --> 00:26:35.280
It's 1, 0, 0, 0,

00:26:35.280 --> 00:26:36.780
negative 1.

00:26:36.840 --> 00:26:38.500
OK, why does this work?

00:26:38.500 --> 00:26:39.220
Well, remember,

00:26:39.220 --> 00:26:39.960
Ax,

00:26:39.960 --> 00:26:44.500
when x is 1, 0, 0, 0, negative
1,

00:26:44.500 --> 00:26:47.260
is just saying make a linear
combination of A's columns where

00:26:47.260 --> 00:26:49.340
you take one of the first
column,

00:26:49.340 --> 00:26:51.000
ignore columns 2, 3, and 4,

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:52.720
and take negative 1 of the last
column.

00:26:52.720 --> 00:26:57.800
So all of this is saying is
