00:27:06.240 --> 00:27:08.940
Do we see where that's coming
from? If you took this matrix

00:27:08.940 --> 00:27:12.520
and multiplied it by 1, 0, 0, 0,
negative 1,

00:27:12.520 --> 00:27:15.540
all it's asking for is this
