00:27:15.540 --> 00:27:18.380
But those are the same column or
the same vector.

00:27:18.380 --> 00:27:20.060
So if you subtract them,

00:27:20.060 --> 00:27:22.720
it gets 0'd out.

00:27:22.720 --> 00:27:24.220
Do we see where that came from?

00:27:24.220 --> 00:27:24.740
OK.

00:27:24.740 --> 00:27:29.420
So what I want you to do now is
